msgstr "Akaunti yako itafutwa kabisa tarehe {purgeDate}. Umetolewa nje. Ili kughairi, ingia tena kabla ya tarehe hiyo."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx:84
msgid "Your account will be scheduled for deletion and you'll be signed out. You can cancel any time before the deletion date by logging back in. Download your data first if you want to keep a copy."
msgstr "Akaunti yako itapangwa kufutwa na utatolewa nje. Unaweza kughairi wakati wowote kabla ya tarehe ya kufutwa kwa kuingia tena. Pakua data yako kwanza ikiwa unataka kuhifadhi nakala."

